# Force LF for source/text files regardless of local core.autocrlf — Biome's
# formatter (biome.json) expects LF and has no lineEnding override, so a
# Windows checkout with autocrlf=true was rewriting every file to CRLF and
# failing `pnpm lint` on files nobody had touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
